### Feature Branch — UPDATE (PUT) / UPDATE (PATCH)
### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@id = 1

# @name updateBranchPut
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/sucursales/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sucursal Norte Renovada",
  "description": "Sede ampliada zona norte",
  "status": "active"
}

###

# @name updateBranchPatch
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/sucursales/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Solo cambio de descripción"
}
